  "releaseNotes": "Renames CUDA implementation paths, namespaces, workers, kernels, catalogs, and tests. Decouples resident-search fingerprint capacity from the total raw proposal universe. Reserves fingerprint capacity for accepted state, pending refresh programs, and remaining trials. Adds deterministic typed-program catalogs with global cursor resume and archive-preserving transitions. Adds exact host-side CUDA capacity planning for explicit catalogs.",
